Use Wine 11's managed client-surface bridge for DXMT presentation.

Applies after dxmt-e94c312f-wine-11-win-data.patch to pinned DXMT revision
 e94c312f5c054263acf261cfa109edf13e757587. Requires the matching original
wine-11.0-dxmt-client-surface.patch. It replaces the private window-layout
fallback with a versioned opaque create/prepare/release API. A fresh managed
surface exists before Metal-view creation, and each Present reactivates it.
Unix call 146 is appended to both dispatch tables, preserving existing ordinals
and the fixed-width x64/WoW64 argument layout. No installed vendor code is used.

Offered under DXMT's LGPL-2.1-or-later terms.

